{
  "id": "PHM.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "PHM",
  "reference": "Filemoni 1",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PHM 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche Paulo, omosibwa ase engencho ya Kristo Yeso, boigo korwa ase oyominto Timotheo ase Filemoni, omwanchwa oito, omokori emeremo amo naintwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na abanto b’ekanisa ekoumerana ase enyomba yao, naboigo Apia, mosubati ominto, na Arikipo, omorwani ore amo naintwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiga Nyasae tata oito na Omonene Yeso Kristo abae obuya na omorembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obwanchani bwa Filemoni na okwegena kwaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyominto Filemoni, ase ogosaba kwane botambe nigo ngoakera Nyasae one ng’a mbuya mono ekero ngokoinyora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayio nase engencho nkoigwa amang’ana igoro y’obwanchani bwao ase abanto bonsi b’Omonene, na okwegena kwao obwate ase Omonene Yeso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasabire ng’a okobwatana gw’okwegena tore nakorokwo gokore emeremo, erinde omanye mono kobua kera egento ogosesenigwa kore ase tore intwe ase okobwatana na Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki oyominto, nigo nabeete nomogooko omonge na okoremigwa ase engencho y’obwanchani bwao! Chinkoro chi’abaanto b’Omonene bonsi chiasasokire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo ogosabera Onesimo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, ninde noboremu obonge buna momura omino ase Kristo kogochika eri ogwenerete okore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ase engencho y’obwanchani bwane ase ore, nanchire kobua kogosorora, buna inche Paulo inde omotomwa, naende inde omosibwa o Kristo Yeso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nagosoroire ase ribaga riaye omwana one ase Kristo, Onesimo oyio ekero nare ase egesibo kiane, obete omwana one kemoika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo kare tarenge taisainegento kende ase ore, korende bono obeire oyo bw’engeencho mono ase ore nainche boigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere namotomire gocha ase ore, na nigo enga buna nigo abogoretie enkoro yane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki inche nigo narenge kogania abeere aiga amo nainche ase nsibire ase engencho y’enchiri, erinde anyare gonkorera ribaga riao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende tindigeti okore ing’ana rinde rionsi ase ogokobetereria erio aye onkoonye, korende erio ebe ase ogwancha kwao aye omonyene. Inche tinkonyara gokora ing’ana rinde rionsi otatiga aye gwancheranire narirorio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aande nakio kiagerete Onesimo agaatananwa korwa ase ore ase ekero egeke, erinde airane koba ase ore ase ebiro bionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende ere bono tari buna omosomba, korende goetania omosomba; buna oyominto omwanchwa, ase Kristo. Asende mono, na ase ore mono kobua, buna omosomba, naende buna oyominto ase Omonene!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki, onye kondengereretie inche buna omobwatani oo, omooroisie koreng’ana buna kware kondoisia inche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye okomocheire ase ing’ana rinde rionsi, gose okoriete esira, oyeborie goetera ase ’nde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche Paulo nariikire aya nokoboko kwane omonyene, ning’akane. Amaene, ninyare kogoteebia, ng’a nore nesira ase ’nde, ase obogima bwao aye omonyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, oyominto, ninganetie obokonyi bokorwa ase ore, ekiagera noyo bw’Omonene ore. Buna oyominto ase Kristo, ong’e omoyo!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninde nobomaene aiga buna ngokoriikera aya, ng’a nokore buna nagosabire ekiagera nomoigweri ore, naende ase ayio nimanyete ng’a nokore goetania.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amo nayio, ondoiserie aase ngocha komenya, naki ninsemeretie ng’a Omonene Nyasae nayairanerie goetera ase ogosaba kwaino mwensi erio imbe nainwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amakwania y’ogokoorera",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epafara, oyosibire amo nainche ase engencho ya Kristo Yeso, ogokwanirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo Mariko na Aristariko, na Dema, na Luka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHM 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obuya bw’Omonene oito Yeso Kristo bobe amo nainwe mwensi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHM.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHM.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
